--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Entities and memberships: `entities` and `entity_memberships` tables, with the database rejecting a second owner per entity (stored generated `owner_seq` and unique index). Policies for entity and membership, the `UserRole` enum, and `entity.pick` (stores the current entity in the session and audits the choice).
+- Entity management pages (owner/admin/employee aware): dashboard, members (add by e-mail, assign roles, remove) and owner-only settings (rename, slug, delete and ownership transfer). Domain writes live in `app/Actions/*`. See [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
